# UI design → web-design-engineer + ThaiShopFun DS

When designing or changing visual UI in this repo:

1. **First** read `~/.cursor/skills/web-design-engineer/SKILL.md` and follow its workflow (quality bar, dials, critique).
2. **Then** follow `.cursor/rules/thaishopfun-design-system.mdc` for tokens, components, i18n, and “reuse existing / no unauthorized redesign.”
3. Prefer existing ThaiShopFun components and CSS variables over inventing a new visual system.
4. New marketing/landing or greenfield visual surfaces may lean on the skill’s craft; product shells (merchant/admin/buyer app chrome) stay aligned with the design system.
